le":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>jojo11</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/845335-character-sheet?p=1174597#post1174597\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Here's what that would look like.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1l7I3ZQhR4KdADUeEXWX1fdw29lHMhDJJ/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1l7I3ZQhR4KdADUeEXWX1fdw29lHMhDJJ/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1l7I3ZQhR4KdADUeEXWX1fdw29lHMhDJJ/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/file/d/1l7I3ZQhR4KdADUeEXWX1fdw29lHMhDJJ/view?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Just a quick Photoshop mock-up based on Mr. Gone's earlier sheet -- don't have the fonts installed to make real changes</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, I got ya. Yea, I could do that. Sorry, I was over thinking it I guess...lol.<br /> <br /> What does everyone else think?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-10T02:27:15-08:00","id":1174808,"title":"","content":"That makes it easier to track Clarity-as-Health but harder to tract what touchstone is attached to what 'health' level.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-10T08:44:36-08:00","id":1174878,"title":"","content":"I was thinking about De_K47's suggestion of putting numbers under the health track and those numbers correspond to the Touchstones listed below.<br /> <br /> It's really hard to envision what they intend for the sheet to look like. Maybe they'll revise some of the descriptions once they actually start drafting a character sheet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11557-jojo11","name":"jojo11","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-10T12:02:21-08:00","id":1174934,"title":"","content":"I personally like the idea of Clarity being a vertical health track (though elongated a bit) with space next to each for it's touchstones. I think that the dots and squares should look and feel like the health and willpower sections but vertical. Maybe have expanded Touchstones portion for 2/4 page versions. <br /> <br /> Another idea is to have the best of both worlds:<br /> <br /> Have a (albeit smaller) horizontal track under the Health and before the Willpower with Circles to denote the total, and squares to denote the severity of the damage. and then below the Glamour Pool can be a vertical track where touchstones go but with circles to the right of the spaces for the user to fill in how much total the character has. (should the clarity be numbered in both cases to make it even easier or would that clutter it up too much?)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-12T04:25:11-08:00","id":1175418,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>jojo11</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/845335-character-sheet?p=1174878#post1174878\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's really hard to envision what they intend for the sheet to look like. Maybe they'll revise some of the descriptions once they actually start drafting a character sheet.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know. That's why I might just leave it as-is for now, until we get a clearer picture what they're thinking.<br /> <br /> Though, I might do a draft with the horizontal tract and the section of lines as you suggested above, just to give people a second option for now.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xiongrey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/845335-character-sheet?p=1174934#post1174934\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I personally like the idea of Clarity being a vertical health track (though elongated a bit) with space next to each for it's touchstones. I think that the dots and squares should look and feel like the health and willpower sections but vertical. Maybe have expanded Touchstones portion for 2/4 page versions.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which is pretty much how I have it now. Seemed the easiest way to do it given the description I head.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xiongrey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/845335-character-sheet?p=1174934#post1174934\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Another idea is to have the best of both worlds:<br /> <br /> Have a (albeit smaller) horizontal track under the Health and before the Willpower with Circles to denote the total, and squares to denote the severity of the damage. and then below the Glamour Pool can be a vertical track where touchstones go but with circles to the right of the spaces for the user to fill in how much total the character has. (should the clarity be numbered in both cases to make it even easier or would that clutter it up too much?)</div> </div> </div> </div>We considered that, having it presented two ways, but I feel like it takes up space on the sheet for not much benefit. So if we're going to do lines with boxes(or dots) next to them, might as well just commit to that style. If that makes sense...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member